  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "I don’t dislike Option 2 and Option 3 per se. I just\nthink Option 1 is the way to go.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƲ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Both Option 1 and Option 3 lack impact. I think\nwe should go with my suggestion: Option 2.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "My proposal, Option 3, is the most fitting of all.\nBut you two just refuse to budge, don’t you?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Well then, how about we ask this young person\nhere for h<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂiser opinion?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƲ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 1072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Now there’s a good idea at last! We’re getting\nnowhere just going round in circles ourselves.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You there! Young <U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿЃmanlady! Could you give us a hand?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F0075002000740068006500720065002100200059006F0075006E0067002000100003110000FF0403006D0061006E006C006100640079002100200043006F0075006C006400200079006F00750020006700690076006500200075007300200061002000680061006E0064003F00100002011401B40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "See, this street needs a new name—one that will\nreally grab people’s attention.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We want to draw more visitors to our street with\na name that captures the imagination.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So why don’t you help us decide? After all, this\ntown will belong to your generation someday.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We each came up with our own idea.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƲ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 2100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006500200065006100630068002000630061006D0065002000750070002000770069007400680020006F007500720020006F0077006E00200069006400650061002E00100002011401B20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "My idea is <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Lumiose Grand Avenue<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI know it’s a bit too grand for this little old street,\nbut that’s how we’ll entice people to visit!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƲ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 2180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 149
    },
    {
      "displayText": "My proposal is <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Mega Evolution Road<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nOf course, there’s not really anything around here\nrelated to Mega Evolution, but isn’t it evocative?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 153
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m suggesting <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Borevard Boulevard<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nWe might as well tell people what they’re in for,\nand this little boulevard is as boring as they come.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 153
    },
    {
      "displayText": "They’ve all got their selling points, but none is the\nclear winner.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIt’s like going around in a circle between Fire,\nWater, and Grass types!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƲ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 3096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 148
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What do you think? Which name would you pick?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 3392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005700680061007400200064006F00200079006F00750020007400680069006E006B003F0020005700680069006300680020006E0061006D006500200077006F0075006C006400200079006F00750020007000690063006B003F00100002011401B30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 3492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Have you decided? Do you know which name\nwould be perfect for our street?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƲ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 3504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ve got it",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 3660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004920190076006500200067006F00740020006900740000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let me think...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 3684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500740020006D00650020007400680069006E006B002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh! Well, let’s hear it at once! Which of our ideas\nis the winner?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00680021002000570065006C006C002C0020006C0065007420190073002000680065006100720020006900740020006100740020006F006E0063006500210020005700680069006300680020006F00660020006F00750072002000690064006500610073000A006900730020007400680065002000770069006E006E00650072003F00100002011401B30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Option 1: Lumiose Grand Avenue",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F007000740069006F006E00200031003A0020004C0075006D0069006F007300650020004700720061006E00640020004100760065006E007500650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Option 2: Mega Evolution Road",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F007000740069006F006E00200032003A0020004D006500670061002000450076006F006C007500740069006F006E00200052006F006100640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
